{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">a balloon.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Caught by the wind, the balloon was drawn toward the goshinboku and snagged on one of its branches.</STYLE><PG>
"Waaaah!! My balloon!!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">So that balloon was </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="3">'s.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">In wind like this, it couldn't be helped that it blew away.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Once the wind died down, I'd just buy her another one.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\罅（ひび）\桜3.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
