{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"</STYLE>Natsumi-chan<STYLE ID="10">, don't cry. Look, I'll go get it for you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Really...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Yeah! Believe it or not, I climbed lots of trees when I was a kid!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> said that and hobbled off toward the goshinboku.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">No, hold on, even if he did climb trees as a kid, isn't that impossible with that build...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Besides, he can't even move one of his legs properly.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Paying no mind to my worry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> climbed the goshinboku with unusual nimbleness.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\罅（ひび）\桜2.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, don't push yourself! Come down!</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">We can just buy another balloon!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Hup! I may not look it, but I grew up in the mountains of the Arata settlement! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　Hah! Climbing a tree is nothing!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">As if to defy my worry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> reached the branch where the balloon was caught in no time at all.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">He might have that build, but his tree-climbing skills were apparently the real thing.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> stretched his hand out as far as he could toward the balloon.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\罅（ひび）\桜1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
