{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">But the goshinboku's branch began to creak and groan.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, get down here, quick! It's going to break!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Just a little more... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">I've almost got it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I happened to look directly below </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, and...</STYLE><PG>
