<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="4">! Get out of the way!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">If </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> fell, </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="3"> would be crushed beneath him.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I hurried toward </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="3">, but―</STYLE><PG>
