<STYLE ID="3">―At that moment, an eerie sound rang out, the kind that made you want to cover your ears.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Like an old iron door being moved, or like a huge, </STYLE><STYLE ID="15" RUBY="さ">rusted</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> wheel being turned.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The sound echoed throughout Central Park.</STYLE><PG>
{CHGVOL "SE2" "500" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHGVOL "BGM2" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">For a moment the sound stole my attention, but right after, </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> came into view.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Whether he </STYLE><STYLE ID="16" RUBY="ひる">flinched</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> at that eerie sound or was caught by the strong wind, I couldn't tell.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> lost his grip on the goshinboku, and―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">That moment was like watching something in slow motion.</STYLE><PG>
