<STYLE ID="3">I ran to the one covered in </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s blood, to </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "100" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Without a word, I just held her tight.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I can't let </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="3"> see this place anymore...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
